    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d349">

                <pb facs="0587" n="1173" sameAs="frus:frus1949v07p2/pg1173"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890.20/7–2549: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Philippines</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Lockett</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Manila</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-07-25T18:00:00+08:00">July 25, 1949—6 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1805. Carlos Romulo today made to me statement summarized below:</p>
                <p>He is seeking alter direction given Pacific Union by Chiang-Quirino
                    conversations.… Romulo told Quirino he should first have approached Nehru, that
                    Australia should be brought into planned union so it would not take on
                    anti-white appearance and that elimination colonialism should be one of union’s
                    objectives. He also encountering difficulty persuading Quirino [that] Pacific
                    Union should be publicized as non-Communist rather than anti-Communist and that
                    it could later emerge as instrument through which member nations might cooperate
                    combat Communism.</p>
                <pb facs="0588" n="1174" xml:id="pg1174"/>
                <p>Romulo intends spend July and August working on plan for UN, but until he and
                    President reach fundamental agreement he does not propose approach other
                    governments. He hopes, however, evolve union nations this area which US will be
                    able accept and this general connection made assertion State Department needs do
                    some new thinking regarding Far East.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lockett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
